Field contract: supporting_evidence contains exact claim and review IDs only. Assign each subject a unique local subject_id. For every required participant_subjects key, return the subject_id of the person who is that speaker. A person may have several participant occurrences. Speakers still require person subjects when no claim describes them; those subjects may have empty supporting_evidence. Never assign a speaker to the person they merely report about. alternate_names contains explicitly given names, never evidence IDs.
